WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
One plain request: a landing page for Harbourline Dental — and an automation that emails every booking.

00:05.500 --> 00:13.500
The machine plans and builds the website first.

00:13.500 --> 00:18.000
Website built, checked, and published — eight seconds in.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
The same request now fires the automation build. No second ask.

00:24.000 --> 00:58.000
The automation is generated, then independently checked before anything is delivered.

00:58.000 --> 01:04.000
A working workflow file, delivered beside the live site.

01:04.000 --> 01:11.000
The published page — live on the public internet.

01:11.000 --> 01:13.000
Every step left a receipt.
